# Hindi grammar of the controlled output fragment (issue #1584), in Devanagari.
# One description drives three directions: realization, parsing (its exact
# inverse) and validation. Every word list here is project-authored: NSM prime
# exponents follow the published Hindi table (Junker; Goddard & Wierzbicka),
# with the inflected allolexes the explications use. The STE, Minimal, Basic,
# Special, Globish and Gellish lists are small project-authored Hindi analogs
# that cover exactly the words their profiles' templates and registers need;
# none of them is an official Hindi edition of that standard. Frequency tiers
# are project-authored upper rank bounds, not a corpus.
# Hindi marks case (direct/oblique), number and gender. A slot names a declared
# form: dir, obl (before a postposition), pl, plobl, and gen, the genitive
# marker already agreeing with the noun it introduces ("का जानवर", "की बिल्ली"),
# so "एक तरह {x.gen}" stays grammatical for every gender.
# E-Prime: every form of होना ("to be", including the auxiliary है/हैं of the
# present tense) is listed as copula. A positive Hindi present-tense clause
# cannot drop है, so the eprime style states classification rules with the
# copula-free passive future ("…को … की श्रेणी में रखा जाएगा", the classifying
# future used in Hindi grammar books) and need with the verbless modal चाहिए.
# Input-only surfaces: मूषक names the rodent and is also the Hindi technical
# term for the computer mouse, so a question with it asks which one is meant.
cnl-language hi
  keys "dir|obl|pl|plobl|gen"
  grammar "का|की|के|में|से|को|पर|तो|कि|क्या|भी|और|न|नहीं|यह|वह|ये|इस|उस|उसका|उसकी|जो|लिए|साथ|वाला|वाली|वाले|हुए|है|हैं|हो|हूँ|एक"
  copula "है|हैं|हूँ|हो|हों|था|थी|थे|थीं|होना|होने|होता|होती|होते|होतीं|होगा|होगी|होंगे|होंगी|होऊँ|होऊँगा|होऊँगी"
  pronouns "यह|वह|ये|वे|वो|इसे|उसे|इन्हें|उन्हें|इसका|उसका|इसकी|उसकी|इसके|उसके|इनका|उनका|इनकी|उनकी|इनके|उनके"
  fillers "अरे|यार|भाई|ज़रा|जरा|प्लीज़|प्लीज|कृपया|हम्म|अम्म|उम्म|मतलब|वैसे|सुनो|सुनिए|ओके|ओह|जल्दी से"
  loose "हैं=है|की=का|के=का|होती=होता|होते=होता|हिस्से=हिस्सा"
  typos "उंगली=उँगली|उंगलियां=उँगलियाँ|उंगलियों=उँगलियों|बिल्लियां=बिल्लियाँ|बिलली=बिल्ली|बिल्ल्ली=बिल्ली|कुता=कुत्ता|कुते=कुत्ते|पेड=पेड़|पेडों=पेड़ों|पता=पत्ता|पत्त=पत्ता|जानवार=जानवर|जनवर=जानवर|पोधा=पौधा|पौदा=पौधा|कम्प्यूटर=कंप्यूटर|कम्प्यूटरों=कंप्यूटरों|कंप्युटर=कंप्यूटर|कमप्यूटर=कंप्यूटर|पासवड=पासवर्ड|पासवर्ड्स=पासवर्डों|खता=खाता|चुहा=चूहा|चूहें=चूहे|चीज=चीज़|चीजें=चीज़ें|चीजों=चीज़ों|जरूरी=ज़रूरी|फंक्शन=फ़ंक्शन|फैक्टोरियल=फ़ैक्टोरियल|हां=हाँ|हूं=हूँ|नही=नहीं|कया=क्या"
  prime "I: मैं|मुझे|मेरे"
  prime "YOU: आप|तुम|आपको|तुम्हें"
  prime "SOMEONE: कोई|किसी"
